       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ABENDTST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 LOG-DATA.
           COPY ABNDINFO.
       01 ABEND-CODE PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC CICS HANDLE ABEND LABEL(ON-ABEND) END-EXEC.
           IF EIBAID = X'F3'
               EXEC CICS ABEND ABCODE('TST5') CANCEL END-EXEC
           END-IF.
           EXEC CICS ABEND ABCODE('TST4') NODUMP END-EXEC.
       ON-ABEND SECTION.
           EXEC CICS ASSIGN ABCODE(ABEND-CODE) END-EXEC.
           INITIALIZE LOG-DATA.
           MOVE ABEND-CODE TO ABND-CODE.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ABNDPROC')
               COMMAREA(LOG-DATA) END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('OMEN')
               COMMAREA(ABEND-CODE) LENGTH(4) END-EXEC.
